{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "meta": {
    "id": "confession-booth",
    "title": "Confession Booth",
    "description": "Inverts the flow: this generator doesn't produce a resource, it consumes one. Guilt is a byproduct of every purchase in the game — spend anything, anywhere, and some of it taxes into Guilt. The Booth converts Guilt into Absolution, the only currency lifetime enough of which lets you prestige."
  },
